"Get Telegram webhook url:  https://core.telegram.org/bots#how-do-i-create-a-bot\n- Interactive env use `x telegram init` to initialize configuration. The configure will be saved locally.\n- Run command `x telegram --cfg webhook=<webhook_url>` to add webhook url.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"Telegram webhook url 获取: https://core.telegram.org/bots#how-do-i-create-a-bot\n- 交互环境中可使用 `x telegram init` 进行初始化配置，配置信息将存放于本地保存\n- 亦可运行命令 `x telegram --cfg webhook=<webhook_url>` 添加 webhook url\n"
}
]
